{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:33 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:33 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:33 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/bc151f7a5b81695d4f834baf08273e9c/2026-11/page_136.jpg\"/><p>薄扶林發生交通意外。今日（16日）早上8時07分，一輛客貨車由置富南區廣場卸貨區駛出，右轉入置富道，其間在斑馬線撞倒一名正在過路的73歲姓方婦人。救護員到場發現女事主昏迷，隨即將她送往瑪麗醫院搶救。警方經初步調查，以涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害，拘捕客貨車的36歲姓何男司機，他正被扣留調查。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:21.023871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:33:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:51.328257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:52.228261+00:00","content_hash":"f7bf1dc54628f05e43be60e51a124b5eab648a4f5f4e93e44dabf71c707fefe7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}